<title>PHILIPPINES: Belle Corp Q1 net 504.44 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Belle Corp Q1 net 504.44 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>			(in million pesos)</p>
<p>    Revenues		     806.50 vs 357.80</p>
<p>    Net income		   504.44 vs 141.73</p>
<p>Note: Full name Belle Corp. The company, which runs golf courses and is planning to set up a hotel and casino, said the figures are unaudited.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
